WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.463
Badger, Rat, and Mole arrived at Toad Hall.

2
00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:07.176
"Badger was right," said Mole.

3
00:00:07.177 --> 00:00:09.027
"Look at that."

4
00:00:09.028 --> 00:00:13.324
A shiny car was parked at the house.

5
00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:18.751
It was painted red—Toad's favorite color.

6
00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:23.167
"It sure is big," said Rat.

7
00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:26.480
"I'll knock on the door," said Badger.

8
00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:30.740
But before he could, the door burst open.

9
00:00:30.741 --> 00:00:35.391
"Hello!" shouted Toad, smiling.

10
00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:38.961
Toad wore long gloves and a coat.

11
00:00:38.962 --> 00:00:41.876
Goggles covered his eyes.

12
00:00:41.877 --> 00:00:45.660
"You are just in time!" said Toad.

13
00:00:45.661 --> 00:00:50.898
"It's time for a ride in my new car!"

14
00:00:50.899 --> 00:00:54.128
The three friends stared at him.

15
00:00:54.129 --> 00:00:57.351
"What a silly outfit!" said Rat.

16
00:00:57.352 --> 00:01:00.033
"What's wrong?" said Toad.

17
00:01:00.034 --> 00:01:03.684
"These are my driving clothes."

18
00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:08.145
"Take him inside," said Badger.

19
00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:11.454
Rat and Mole grabbed Toad.

20
00:01:11.455 --> 00:01:15.613
"Hey, let go of me!" yelled Toad.

21
00:01:15.614 --> 00:01:19.078
He kicked his legs in the air.

22
00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.974
They dragged Toad back into his house.

23
00:01:22.975 --> 00:01:26.441
"Now then," Badger said to Toad,

24
00:01:26.442 --> 00:01:30.365
"take off those stupid clothes!"

25
00:01:30.366 --> 00:01:34.679
"I will not!" cried Toad proudly.

26
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.347
"I won't!"

27
00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:40.873
"Boys, take off his things!" Badger said.

28
00:01:40.874 --> 00:01:44.444
The three friends went right to work.

29
00:01:44.445 --> 00:01:49.014
"I'll sit on him," said Rat.

30
00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:52.862
"Here, I've got his gloves," said Mole.

31
00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:56.028
"I've got his goggles," said Badger.

32
00:01:56.029 --> 00:01:58.862
They pulled at his cap and coat.

33
00:01:58.863 --> 00:02:01.823
Toad kicked angrily.

34
00:02:01.824 --> 00:02:04.781
"Ahhh!" screamed Toad.

35
00:02:04.782 --> 00:02:11.862
"What are you doing?"

